{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"prelim-2005-deet-science2-13","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2005,"subject":"chemistry","number":13,"points":null,"unitId":"lab","unitLabel":"실험·분석화학","topic":"적정·표준용액·실험과정","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["lab","equilibrium","gas"],"stem":"Ca(OH)2의용해도곱상수는농도를알고있는NaOH 수용액\n에Ca(OH)2를포화시킨후용액속OH－의농도를염산표준\n용액으로적정하여결정한다. 실험과정중에서잘못되기시작한\n단계는?\n<실험과정>\n(가) 깨끗하게씻어건조한4개의100 mL 비커에눈금실\n린더를\n이용하여\n증류수,\n0.025 M,\n0.050 M,\n0.10 M\nNaOH 용액50 mL씩을각각넣는다.\n(나) 4개의비커에각각약숟가락반정도의고체Ca(OH)2\n을넣고10분동안교반하여평형에도달하도록한다.\n(다) 뷰흐너깔때기를이용하여각비커의용액에서고체를\n분리하고, 거른액을새비커에보관한다.\n(라) 뷰흐너깔때기에연결했던플라스크의벽에묻은용액\n을증류수로세척한후, 세척액을(다)에서보관한거른\n액과합한다.\n(마) (라)의용액25 mL를피펫으로취하여100 mL 삼각\n플라스크에넣고페놀프탈레인용액2～3 방울을첨가한\n후0.1 M 염산표준용액으로적정한다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018","t019","t020","t021","t022","t023"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"가","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t024"]},{"number":2,"text":"나","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t025"]},{"number":3,"text":"다","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t026"]},{"number":4,"text":"라","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t027"]},{"number":5,"text":"마","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t028"]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":193,"height":6,"region":1,"bbox":[236.55,25.453,77.2,2.4],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/prelim-2005-deet-science2-13/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":744,"height":680,"region":1,"bbox":[14.15,54.253,297.6,272.0],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018","t019","t020","t021","t022","t023"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/prelim-2005-deet-science2-13/02.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":4,"sourceRect":[373.089,930.721,690.55,954.041],"width":317.462,"height":23.32,"items":[{"id":"t001","type":"tex